    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Aviary</strong> is a relaxing idle bird collector that sits at the bottom of your screen! Hatch unique birds, sell them, decorate their home, then watch them fly around your screen and perch on top of your other windows!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER NEW SPECIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your collection of over 50 bird species + unique color variants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/703319874317f93c2ea49c1ccf3b967e.poster.avif?t=1755277967\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/703319874317f93c2ea49c1ccf3b967e.webm?t=1755277967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your aviary with a variety of decorations for your birds to perch on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/178719352b977af777b140f587ebba71.poster.avif?t=1755277967\" width=780 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3437350/extras/178719352b977af777b140f587ebba71.webm?t=1755277967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BREED NEW LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed your best birds to maximize profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn fun facts about each species you discover (global population, habitat. etc)\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the perfect aviary for all your birds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your birds chill on the bottom of your screen or move the window to wherever you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time day/night cycle</p></li></ul>",
